{"id":"n85791-2-7","stage":5,"title":"형사 · 刑警","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85791-2-7-1","ko":"오늘 아침에 형사가 찾아와서 옆집 남자를 아냐고 묻던데.","zh":"今天早上有警察来找过，问我们是否认识隔壁的男子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"아침에","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아침에","audio":"/audio/930cc492b37cd832fc24.mp3"}},{"text":"형사가","meaning":"刑警","explanation":"형사：刑警；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"형사","audio":"/audio/6ec724957bed78854ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85791","senseId":"2","lemma":"형사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형사가","audio":"/audio/c59ee26ba7d7a3ca4b8c.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아와서","meaning":"来找，来访，访问","explanation":"찾아오다：来找，来访，访问；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"찾아오다","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60322","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾아오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아와서","audio":"/audio/5d57cd698f0d3297cdad.mp3"}},{"text":"옆집","meaning":"邻居，隔壁","explanation":"옆집：邻居，隔壁。","readings":[{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71723","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3"}},{"text":"남자를","meaning":"男子，男人","explanation":"남자：男子，男人；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":